{"id":"u_bertrieben","lemma":"übertrieben","pos":"adv","rank":2718,"glosses":["very, inordinately"],"ipa":"/ˌyːbɐˈtʁiːbn̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/30/De-%C3%BCbertrieben.ogg/De-%C3%BCbertrieben.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe übertrieben.","en":"I exaggerated.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/240784","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null]},{"text":"Wir haben übertrieben.","en":"We exaggerated.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/273987","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},null]},{"text":"Ich dachte, die Leute übertrieben.","en":"I thought people were exaggerating.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"people"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe es wohl ein bisschen übertrieben.","en":"I think I overdid it a bit.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"possibly, probably"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bit"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe es anscheinend übertrieben.","en":"I seem to have overdone it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"apparently"},null]}]}